<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key><string>Safari 下载清除同步</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>总开关</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>打开：Safari 清除下载记录时，同步删除磁盘上的文件。关闭：保留文件，并拦截 Safari 自己的删除。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>启用插件</string>
			<key>key</key><string>enabled</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.safaridownloadpurge</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>清除场景</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>分别控制“清除单个下载”和“清除全部下载”。多选删除按单个处理。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>单个清除时删除文件</string>
			<key>key</key><string>purgeSingle</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.safaridownloadpurge</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>清除全部时删除文件</string>
			<key>key</key><string>purgeClearAll</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.safaridownloadpurge</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>安全策略</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>「保留安装包」默认关闭。打开后，ipa / deb / dmg / rar / 7z 等文件只清记录不删文件，看起来就像插件没生效，请按需开启。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>保留安装包与压缩包</string>
			<key>key</key><string>keepInstallers</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.safaridownloadpurge</string>
			<key>default</key><false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>调试</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>打开「只记录不删除」后，插件不会删除任何文件，只写日志。排查问题时才打开，平时请保持关闭。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>只记录不删除（调试）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>logOnly</string>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.safaridownloadpurge</string>
			<key>default</key><false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>说明</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>插件作用于 Safari 的下载列表。删除前会核对文件位于下载目录且没有其他下载记录引用。修改设置后无需重启 Safari，也无需注销。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
